        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule one. Your club has to be in the top four right now.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "RULE 1",
        "body": "His club must be in the top four after nine games."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Arsenal, City, Brighton and Chelsea. Liverpool are fifth, Bournemouth eighth, United seventeenth.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "Table after 9 games",
        "rows": [
          {
            "pos": 1,
